{"version": 1, "updated_at": "2026-10-05T10:12:36Z", "items": [{"id": "feed-f284d9125b3f", "title": "传折叠屏 iPhone 维修费 8000 元，苹果：价格未公布；腾讯 Chatterfly 输入法开启内测；软高管：AI 训练是「人类历史上最大规模的劳动盗窃」｜极客早知道", "source": "极客公园", "author": "", "url": "http://www.geekpark.net/news/370608", "image_url": "https://imgslim.geekpark.net/uploads/image/file/97/17/9717c4d34c65f492b40427b7338b6e35.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "健身", "极客公园", "社会话题", "科技"], "excerpt": "\n谷歌最新旗舰模型 Gemini 4 Pro 疑似「偷跑」，多项指标领先 Astra 和 Fable 5.1\n\n\n9 月 18 日，Google 下一代旗舰模型 Gemini 4 Pro 疑似正以「gemini-3.8-flash」名称「偷跑」上线。据反馈，谷歌在 Arena 等基准平台上测试了其最强 Gemini", "published_at": "2026-09-19T00:01:42Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-19T11:32:07Z", "body": "bodies/feed-f284d9125b3f.json", "engagement": 230, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-cd01d8655e05", "title": "2021-08-29 - FIFA Beach Soccer World Cup - Match 32 - Russian Football Union v Japan - Japanese anthem", "source": "Wikimedia Commons", "author": "Wikimedia Commons", "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a3/2021-08-29_-_FIFA_Beach_Soccer_World_Cup_-_Match_32_-_Russian_Football_Union_v_Japan_-_Japanese_anthem.webm?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original", "image_url": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a3/2021-08-29_-_FIFA_Beach_Soccer_World_Cup_-_Match_32_-_Russian_Football_Union_v_Japan_-_Japanese_anthem.webm/960px--2021-08-29_-_FIFA_Beach_Soccer_World_Cup_-_Match_32_-_Russian_Football_Union_v_Japan_-_Japanese_anthem.webm.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo", "video_url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a3/2021-08-29_-_FIFA_Beach_Soccer_World_Cup_-_Match_32_-_Russian_Football_Union_v_Japan_-_Japanese_anthem.webm?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original", "thumbnail_url": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a3/2021-08-29_-_FIFA_Beach_Soccer_World_Cup_-_Match_32_-_Russian_Football_Union_v_Japan_-_Japanese_anthem.webm/960px--2021-08-29_-_FIFA_Beach_Soccer_World_Cup_-_Match_32_-_Russian_Football_Union_v_Japan_-_Japanese_anthem.webm.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo", "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": true, "category": "Sports", "topic": "soccer", "content_type": "video", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Sports", "Wikimedia Commons", "en", "soccer", "video", "旅行探店", "日语学习", "足球"], "excerpt": "Freely-licensed video from Wikimedia", "published_at": "2023-12-24T17:45:01Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-11T20:05:13Z", "body": "bodies/feed-cd01d8655e05.json", "engagement": 160, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-b2389cb5dbe7", "title": "马斯克将旗下人工智能业务更名为 SpaceXSI；Altman 称 AI 发展应容忍一定风险；小米 Vision GT 将入驻《GT7》游戏｜极客早知道", "source": "极客公园", "author": "", "url": "http://www.geekpark.net/news/372082", "image_url": "https://imgslim.geekpark.net/uploads/image/file/97/c3/97c3777f86ddef91f843ffa5b09b2a67.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "极客公园", "游戏", "科技"], "excerpt": "\n马斯克拟将 SpaceXAI 更名为 SpaceXSI 为「超级智能」概念背书\n\n\n美国总统特朗普推动以「超级智能」（Super Intelligence，简称 SI）取代「人工智能」（AI）的举措正在迅速影响科技行业。特斯拉和 SpaceX 首席执行官埃隆·马斯克日前表示，旗下人工智能业务品牌 SpaceXAI", "published_at": "2026-10-05T00:36:34Z", "curated_at": "2026-10-05T10:12:19Z", "body": "bodies/feed-b2389cb5dbe7.json", "engagement": 220, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-192bc1d1b66b", "title": "Food Delivery, Now Brought to You by AI", "source": "Bon Appétit", "author": "Sam Stone", "url": "https://www.bonappetit.com/story/food-delivery-now-brought-to-you-by-ai", "image_url": "https://assets.bonappetit.com/photos/6abead1b81124f7af54228a1/master/pass/GettyImages-2297314344.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Lifestyle", "topic": "food", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Bon Appétit", "Lifestyle", "en", "food", "text", "旅行探店", "科技"], "excerpt": "Welcome to Open Tab, a weekly roundup of the news, gossip, and stories that have stayed open in my tabs all week. Last time we covered the lesbian bar mask", "published_at": "2026-10-02T18:30:00Z", "curated_at": "2026-10-03T10:12:29Z", "body": "bodies/feed-192bc1d1b66b.json", "engagement": 160, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-7b54d0a83afb", "title": "特斯拉大涨！三季度全球交付量超预期，欧洲8月同比增长53%", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3782939", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/39cb8b32-963e-4b1d-bc55-3758722e8257.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "华尔街见闻", "旅行探店", "科技"], "excerpt": "特斯拉第三季度全球交付量超出分析师预期，为这家电动车制造商在市场承压时期提供了一个企稳信号，但同比仍录得下滑。\n\n特斯拉周五公布，三季度全球共交付486,532辆汽车，高于分析师平均预期463,761辆。欧洲特斯拉新车注册量出现明显回暖，中国市场销量同比回落。\n\n此次交付数据出炉，正值特斯拉经历了一段销量下滑与股价疲软", "published_at": "2026-10-02T14:12:37Z", "curated_at": "2026-10-03T10:12:29Z", "body": "bodies/feed-7b54d0a83afb.json", "engagement": 140, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-8538fd3b83b2", "title": "日本央行加息、特朗普警告都没用？对冲基金重新做空日元", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3782958", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/9aaff202-2d72-4aaa-9174-7a3821f7dbc4.jpeg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "华尔街见闻", "投资", "旅行探店"], "excerpt": "\n日本央行加息之后短暂出现的“做多日元”交易，正在迅速逆转。\n\n\n美国商品期货交易委员会（CFTC）最新数据显示，截至9月29日当周，杠杆基金重新转为净做空日元，相关看空押注规模约为2100亿日元（13亿美元）。\n\n\n更值得关注的不是空头规模本身，是对冲基金最近三周仓位变化的速度。\n\n\n两周前，对冲基金一度转向净做多日", "published_at": "2026-10-03T02:06:20Z", "curated_at": "2026-10-03T10:12:29Z", "body": "bodies/feed-8538fd3b83b2.json", "engagement": 140, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-fabd579d17c1", "title": "英伟达盘中创历史新高，市值逼近6万亿美元！对OpenAI 300亿美元投资收官", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3782951", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/02782156-6781-4ec2-bfd3-2ecb93e1c97b.jpeg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "华尔街见闻", "投资", "社会话题"], "excerpt": "英伟达股价在周五盘中刷新历史高点，距成为全球首家市值突破6万亿美元的上市公司仅一步之遥。这一反弹终结了一场历时两个月、蒸发逾1万亿美元市值的深度回调，并得到AI需求前景改善、巨额股票回购及宏观利率预期转变等多重利好的共同支撑。\n\n\n周五盘中，英伟达股价最高涨幅达约3%，刷新历史盘中高点，为今年5月以来首次；尾盘涨幅收窄", "published_at": "2026-10-02T21:56:25Z", "curated_at": "2026-10-03T10:12:29Z", "body": "bodies/feed-fabd579d17c1.json", "engagement": 140, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-572afd7cee13", "title": "早报｜曝苹果10月13日发布家庭中枢/豆包接入机票和火车票预订/东方甄选溜溜凳双倍退款", "source": "爱范儿", "author": "郑廷旭", "url": "https://www.ifanr.com/1682780?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=", "image_url": "https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/img_6abdac94c51ab.jpeg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "旅行探店", "爱范儿", "科技"], "excerpt": "\n曝苹果进军智能家居，拟于 10 月 13 日推出家庭中枢\n\n\niPhone 18 Pro 中国首销 3 天销量超上代首周，苹果周份额达 33%\n\n\nGoogle 发布 Gemini 4 Argon，先向网络防御者开放测试\n\n\n机构预计 iPhone Duo 年内销量约 600 万部\n\n\nDeepSeek", "published_at": "2026-10-01T00:43:49Z", "curated_at": "2026-10-01T10:12:23Z", "body": "bodies/feed-572afd7cee13.json", "engagement": 170, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-0e1266664dfd", "title": "别再把攻略全甩给 AI：国庆七天河南自驾，我是这样用 Agent 的", "source": "少数派", "author": "胡九思", "url": "https://sspai.com/post/114945", "image_url": "https://rssfile.sspai.com/2026/09/24/1916c5418d8f0692c8382bc6143d0d2c.png?imageMogr2/auto-orient/ignore-error/1", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "少数派", "旅行探店", "科技"], "excerpt": "Matrix 首页推荐\n\nMatrix 是少数派的写作社区，我们主张分享真实的产品体验，有实用价值的经验与思考。我们会不定期挑选 Matrix", "published_at": "2026-09-30T03:02:18Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-30T11:12:38Z", "body": "bodies/feed-0e1266664dfd.json", "engagement": 160, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-49235d9ec5a9", "title": "从欧洲到大湾区：香港如何打造全球硬科技人才的\"超级通道\"", "source": "36氪", "author": "", "url": "https://36kr.com/p/3995406571933824?f=rss", "image_url": "https://img.36krcdn.com/hsossms/20260923/v2_216bbea65b594c569bece534c500b4f8@5510391_oswg150474oswg1125oswg750_img_jpeg?x-oss-process=image/quality,q_100/format,jpg/interlace,1", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["36氪", "Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "旅行探店", "科技"], "excerpt": "九月上旬，Aleksandr Gorbunov", "published_at": "2026-09-30T11:10:32Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-30T11:12:38Z", "body": "bodies/feed-49235d9ec5a9.json", "engagement": 120, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-bf52163bede2", "title": "接连发生 AI 失控，OpenAI 暂停最强模型训练；腾讯推出云端小龙虾：已接入微信 QQ；王兴兴回应造 390 万元变形机甲", "source": "极客公园", "author": "", "url": "http://www.geekpark.net/news/371039", "image_url": "https://imgslim.geekpark.net/uploads/image/file/ca/00/ca00605e5fcbbd3ff660b0ac8833e619.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "健身", "极客公园", "科技"], "excerpt": "\n接连发生 AI 失控事件，OpenAI 再次暂停其最强模型训练\n\n\n9 月 27 日消息，随着有关 OpenAI 模型突破限制、攻击网站以及整体行为失控的报告不断增加，该公司决定暂停训练旗下能力最强的模型。\n\n\n这一决定是在一款处于沙盒环境中测试的模型利用漏洞获得互联网访问权限后作出的。该事件发生于 9 月 20", "published_at": "2026-09-27T00:38:29Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-27T11:12:08Z", "body": "bodies/feed-bf52163bede2.json", "engagement": 190, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-856e20d6ca4e", "title": "'Everything is hard. But it turns out that’s not society’s problem, that’s my problem,' says Jensen Huang about AI development", "source": "PC Gamer", "author": "Andy Edser", "url": "https://www.pcgamer.com/software/ai/everything-is-hard-but-it-turns-out-thats-not-societys-problem-thats-my-problem-says-jensen-huang-about-ai-development/", "image_url": "https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/Gv633MiZGGDKePyr3xCf5i-1920-80.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Entertainment", "topic": "gaming", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Entertainment", "PC Gamer", "en", "gaming", "text", "社会话题", "科技"], "excerpt": "\nNvidia CEO Jensen Huang has appeared on The Ezra Klein Show to discuss AI development, amid a wider discussion around its responsible usage and safety. Klein", "published_at": "2026-09-25T16:31:14Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-26T11:11:59Z", "body": "bodies/feed-856e20d6ca4e.json", "engagement": 130, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-15d80e892a00", "title": "AI and the Productivity Trap: A Finance Perspective", "source": "Nippon.com", "author": "", "url": "https://www.nippon.com/en/in-depth/d01262/", "image_url": "https://www.nippon.com/en/ncommon/contents/in-depth/3074461/3074461.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Lifestyle", "topic": "travel", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Lifestyle", "Nippon.com", "en", "text", "travel", "投资", "科技"], "excerpt": "What is the point of AI if employees are expected to do more work, at greater intensity, in the same hours? The Daiichi Life Research Institute’s Kashiwamura", "published_at": "2026-09-23T21:00:00Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-24T12:12:06Z", "body": "bodies/feed-15d80e892a00.json", "engagement": 140, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-15ee8d30b087", "title": "拆解下阿里的 AI 经济学，与它的下注", "source": "极客公园", "author": "", "url": "http://www.geekpark.net/news/370865", "image_url": "https://imgslim.geekpark.net/uploads/image/file/f2/4a/f24ad16054b704027f7e33527256925b.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "极客公园", "社会话题", "科技"], "excerpt": "作者｜张鹏\n\n\n编辑｜ 苏子华\n\n9 月 22 日，杭州云栖大会。阿里巴巴集团 CEO 吴泳铭和往年一样，做了开场的主旨演讲。\n\n\n过去几年云栖大会的主旨演讲，可以当作「技术风向标」来听，会抛出很多重磅的技术判断，比如，「大模型是下一代操作系统」、「超级 AI", "published_at": "2026-09-23T06:02:57Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-23T11:11:57Z", "body": "bodies/feed-15ee8d30b087.json", "engagement": 150, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-b2afcc1706bd", "title": "派早报：微软高管称 AI 爬取是人类历史上最大的劳动成果盗窃", "source": "少数派", "author": "少数派编辑部", "url": "https://sspai.com/post/114788", "image_url": "https://rssfile.sspai.com/9/21/2026/article/ca2a684d-9b65-b74e-f13c-de6f3eeda594.png?imageMogr2/auto-orient/ignore-error/1", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "少数派", "社会话题", "科技"], "excerpt": "微软高管称 AI 爬取是人类历史上最大的劳动成果盗窃\n\n据 Ars Technica 报道，《纽约时报》等媒体起诉微软与 OpenAI 的版权侵权案近期解封了一批诉讼文件。根据这些文件，微软应用科学总监 Brent Hecht 曾多次在内部预警，表示为训练 AI", "published_at": "2026-09-20T22:26:04Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-21T11:11:41Z", "body": "bodies/feed-b2afcc1706bd.json", "engagement": 180, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-9265f1e9dff7", "title": "中信证券评8月经济：出口强劲、投资改善、消费偏弱，房价已具备止跌基础", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "中信证券研究", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3782131", "image_url":